{"seq":7,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:11:08.587Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4f18e13b03a51bd665e9b091ae9ff671d3f2d52e5b202b1a66becc3b6e2c924c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, here are your three answers. I used the #coastal-team history and Moss's Coastal notes.\n\n1. **Who took over and when:** Bettina Kroll took over, effective Monday, October 6, 2025. Moss's Oct 5 prep note says Saltmarsh \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\". It doesn't name the new owner. I inferred Bettina from the later notes and chats, which call it \"Bettina's grocery account\" and \"Sofia's old grocery account\". Please confirm that before it goes in the handover file.\n\n2. **Discount after the correction:** 10%. On Nov 17, 2025, Bettina first posted 12%. A few minutes later she retracted it and corrected it to 10%, saying she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet.\n\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** PD-4827. Kwame opened it on Oct 15, 2025, after Corinne's admin rights went missing. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which is a separate ticket about the door 3 to door 4 exception-report rows."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
